        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu bathi kuSamuweli: “Khulekela izinceku zakho kuJehova uNkulunkulu wakho, ukuze singafi; ngoba senezele lobu bubi kuzo zonke izono zethu ukuba sizicelele inkosi.",
